                "description": "Ashfield Double Cylinder Handleset Kwikset 801ADH - Ashfield Double cylinder is operated by key outside, and key inside. This stylish entryset features edged rectangular mounts. Ashfield handleset is made by Kwikset and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. Solid brass construction ensures it last for many years to come. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
